WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.800
Every sin carries a debt.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.900
And mine was written in blood.

00:00:06.550 --> 00:00:08.500
I was the one behind the wheel that night.

00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:11.100
My recklessness caused the crash,

00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:13.800
yet I was the only one who walked away.

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:16.950
I sat in that cold hallway,

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:19.100
hating myself for surviving.

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:21.100
Behind that glass,

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:23.850
all seven members of my family were dying...

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:25.100
because of me.

00:00:25.350 --> 00:00:27.700
The doctor handed me the bill
that could save them.

00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:30.500
A price I could never afford

00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:32.150
for the lives I ruined.

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:35.000
Then a stranger offered me a way to atone:

00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:36.550
Enter the Dead Zone,

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:38.750
and trade my life for theirs.

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:42.550
Every scar, every drop of my blood

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:44.150
is the debt I owe them.

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:48.000
My life is the only currency left
to buy back their souls.

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:50.350
And if death is the price of their tomorrow...

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:52.750
I will pay to win.
